  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infrastructure Program for the San Pedro Sula Logistics Corridor</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Infraestructura Corredor Logstico - San Pedro Sula</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Ampliar, rehabilitar y mejorar el Segundo Anillo Perifrico entre la cabecera Norte del Ro Chamelecn e Interseccin Gala, dando solucin a los principales cuellos de botella que existen en el cruce de sta va por la ciudad, al tiempo que agiliza el acceso a Puerto Corts.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To expand, rehabilitate, and improve the Second Peripheral Ring Road between the northern headwaters of the Chamelecon river and the Gala intersection, to ease the congestion that occurs as the road cuts through the city, thus affording faster access to Puerto Cortes.</narrative>
  </description>
